k7d|a|Joining two not adjacent angles of a quadrilateral or multilateral figure; running across from corner to corner; crossing at an angle with one of the sides.	j:201l,128,2;1scb,85,8;177e,77,23;se1,62,3;606,51,3;176t,49,6~177e,77,23;1scb,85,8;176t,49,6;606,51,3;se1,62,3;201l,128,2
