kgv|a|Hard to do or to make; beset with difficulty; attended with labor, trouble, or pains; not easy; arduous. ; Hard to manage or to please; not easily wrought upon; austere; stubborn; as, a difficult person.	j:1wl7,47,10;1wl6,23,10;ik9,23,4;161p,16,3;19c4,12,3;1n0e,12,6;1lqt,10,6;24ih,7,3;1hsu,4,10~1hsu,4,10;1wl6,23,10;1wl7,47,10;1lqt,10,6;1n0e,12,6;ik9,23,4;19c4,12,3;161p,16,3;24ih,7,3	e:1e4c,67,4;236j,62,6;r9x,48,23;2911,40,195;1byh,37,274;25v9,36,4;11n0,35,2;1huf,32,9;pni,29,2;1xo5,27,7;ri7,24,5;1mqz,20,11;1pip,18,15;1xo4,18,8;24gy,12,19~1byh,37,274;2911,40,195;r9x,48,23;24gy,12,19;1poa,11,16;1pip,18,15;1mqz,20,11;1huf,32,9;1xo4,18,8;1xo5,27,7;236j,62,6;ri7,24,5;25v9,36,4;1e4c,67,4;pzi,4,3
